3244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/d2c07989500cd4be7987ca7b8befe558.mp4?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Movement powers</h2> You can also affect the movement of your bullets, like making them faster, chase enemies, or slow down and become a mine. If you combine the mine with other powers, you can even create defense turrets. The movement becomes more pronounced as you get higher levels of the power.<br><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/b528f00bbe241e9ca1f94e372ce8959f.poster.avif?t=1701433244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/b528f00bbe241e9ca1f94e372ce8959f.webm?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/b528f00bbe241e9ca1f94e372ce8959f.mp4?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Passive powers</h2> There are also lots of passive powers that improve your chances of winning, like faster movement, healing, luck, and segments that shoot back at incoming projectiles. These powers also amplify when you get higher levels.<br><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/b0677f11262e1bebc73d435ce305b5fb.poster.avif?t=1701433244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/b0677f11262e1bebc73d435ce305b5fb.webm?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/b0677f11262e1bebc73d435ce305b5fb.mp4?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mystery boxes</h2> Sometimes you will come across a mystery box, where you get to choose from 3 power-ups. If you have collected the luck powerup, you will have a higher chance of getting rare power-ups from the box. This allows you to tailor your arsenal to the opposition, and upgrade to insane levels of destruction.<br><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/cf6c6888f9103f68c93688b678e14d69.poster.avif?t=1701433244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/cf6c6888f9103f68c93688b678e14d69.webm?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/cf6c6888f9103f68c93688b678e14d69.mp4?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</h2> Challenge your friends or strangers online, no local server or host required. Each room can fit up to ten players so you can invite all your friends. Create private rooms or allow strangers to join.<br><br>If you don't have enough friends you can also play against bots with varying difficulty. <br><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/3ad5789358d945dfc5bf417bb633e361.poster.avif?t=1701433244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/3ad5789358d945dfc5bf417bb633e361.webm?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/3ad5789358d945dfc5bf417bb633e361.mp4?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLE GAME MODES</h2> You can play free-for-all where everyone tries to kill everyone, or team up against each other, for instance humans vs bots. <br><br>There is more than one way to win the game. The goal can be to grow as long as possible, to kill as many enemies as possible, or to just shoot as many bullets as possible. <br><br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/d7ff23f45a76faa28bf0405bc38b5696.poster.avif?t=1701433244\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/d7ff23f45a76faa28bf0405bc38b5696.webm?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437110/extras/d7ff23f45a76faa28bf0405bc38b5696.mp4?t=1701433244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple game modes (Free-for-all, Co-op, etc).<br></li><li>Configurable goals (Longest train, most kills, etc).<br></li><li>Online multiplayer without need for server, host, or firewall config.<br></li><li>Play with your friends or create and join games with strangers.<br></li><li>Supports mouse/keyboard or controller.<br></li><li>Original soundtrack.<br></li><li>Procedurally generated arenas.<br></li><li>Easy to mod.</li></ul><br>May the best train win, or survive or whatever. Yay!<br><br>",
    "short_description": "Destroy friends, strangers, or bots in this online multiplayer arena shooter. Collect powerups, combine weapons, build your defenses and obliterate the opposition. Hundreds of weapon combinations and multiple game modes.",
